{title: I've Got the Joy, Joy, Joy Down in My Heart}
{artist: Anonymous}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 120}

Verse 1
[G]I've got the joy, joy, joy, joy down in my heart,
[D]down in my heart, [G]down in my heart,
I've got the joy, joy, joy, joy down in my [C]heart,
[G]down in my [D]heart to [G]stay.

Verse 2
[G]I've got the peace that passes understanding down in my heart,
[D]down in my heart, [G]down in my heart,
I've got the peace that passes understanding down in my [C]heart,
[G]down in my [D]heart to [G]stay.

Verse 3
[G]I've got the love of Jesus, love of Jesus down in my heart,
[D]down in my heart, [G]down in my heart,
I've got the love of Jesus, love of Jesus down in my [C]heart,
[G]down in my [D]heart to [G]stay.
